        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1252f285-ea58-4f53-9296-2c33bdcabae0\",\"review_text\":\"Best music streaming app out there!\"},{\"review_id\":\"d396a285-2844-485a-9c9b-cc22a0de1610\",\"review_text\":\"Faak i cant go to the part of the song i like its like i should play the full song\"},{\"review_id\":\"91ad5e92-f927-4b59-bc5d-e7f0fbb49277\",\"review_text\":\"Good quality and quantity of music. Disappointed that stuff disappears for no reason.\"},{\"review_id\":\"305c3fe1-109c-4f52-b7c4-5b95bb526035\",\"review_text\":\"Why am I paying for this? Unable to login, can not reach tech support. Looks like the account was hacked.\"},{\"review_id\":\"edd262aa-52bc-45b4-bec0-af1472a3770c\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this application 👎👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"baaa29a9-4008-4a56-8f78-0a5818ce742b\",\"review_text\":\"Worstttttttttttt\"},{\"review_id\":\"65d20d39-2351-4771-8963-deeb36ba2957\",\"review_text\":\"The ads suck and the company is as souless as any other. If you use spotify, use adblock and support your favorite artists directly.\"},{\"review_id\":\"81d69045-76b9-468f-a05f-c6db1699f106\",\"review_text\":\"This is worst music app I ever use in my life. They only meant with money nothing else benstokes\"},{\"review_id\":\"1f5bc1df-e5c5-4c9b-9362-22c42266c58e\",\"review_text\":\"Smart\"},{\"review_id\":\"b8946ea3-fe9f-4a50-bd0c-df0a642410b2\",\"review_text\":\"যারা গান শুনতে ভালবাসেন তাদের জন্য খুব ভাল একটি আ্যপ।আমার খুব পছন্দের আ্যপ।\"}]}"
